' v1.2's mode cursor (`ShouldShowMouseInteractionCursor`), in a v1.2 game
' (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30`, Paradise Camp). Speak mode: the
' talk sidekick over a person (record 106, the mercenary), none over open
' ground or a door. Fight mode: the fight sidekick over open ground and the
' same person, none over a door or an item lying there. The legacy game draws the sidekick wherever
' the pointer is.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
pointon 106
wait 1
snap talk_person
mapmove 220,220
wait 3
snap talk_ground
mapmove 177,150          ' the tent
wait 3
snap talk_door
fight
mapmove 220,220
wait 3
snap fight_ground
mapmove 177,150
wait 3
snap fight_door
pointon 106
wait 1
snap fight_person
mapmove 172,224          ' an item lying by a tree
wait 3
snap fight_item
quit
